  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE\nProduct Designer\nHouzz \174 2019\0552026\050Led UX\057UI design for Houzz Pro\031s 3D Floor Plans tool across web and mobile\054 designing AR\057LiDAR workflows that helped renovation professionals capture physical spaces in real\055world conditions\056 Previously designed additional core product areas\056\050\nSimplified complex spatial workflows into intuitive mobile\055first experiences\050\nCollaborated closely with engineers to validate designs on\055device and adapt quickly to technical constraints\050\nShaped UX patterns for emerging technologies\054 translating unfamiliar interactions into clear user flows\050\nGuided new designers through product knowledge\054 workflows\054 and design rationale\050\nAudited product consistency and delivered detailed implementation specs aligned with the design system\n\nUX\057UI Designer\nINTOX \174 2018\0552019\050UX\057UI designer for web and mobile projects in healthcare\054 tech\054 banking\054 and defense\056 Managed the full design process\054 facilitated design thinking workshops\054 and worked directly with stakeholders\056\n\nContent Writer and Editor\nHadashot\056com \174 2015\0552018\050Edited\054 translated\054 and categorized high\055volume financial content\056 Developed strong skills in content hierarchy and clarity \n\nSocial Media Manager\nRe\055Levant Design \174 2014\0552015\050Led content strategy and digital presence for a branding studio \055 from concept and visual assets to publication and promotion\056\n\n\nEDUCATION\nUser Experience Design\050Netcraft Academy \174 2018\n\nBD\056s in Design\050Shenkar College of Engineering and Design \174 2010\0552014)
